She's a colleague. I
pointed her in a direction.

822
00:51:11.510 --> 00:51:13.719
- It's hardly the same thing.
- It's worse.

823
00:51:13.721 --> 00:51:17.014
You endangered my job. my
license. our livelihood.

824
00:51:17.016 --> 00:51:18.223
You ruined my fucking life!

825
00:51:18.225 --> 00:51:21.476
Jesus. you sound like children.
And there's just one child here.

826
00:51:21.478 --> 00:51:24.980
- What is that supposed to mean?
- Clay needs us to be his parents now.

827
00:51:24.982 --> 00:51:27.524
- I don't need anything from you guys.
- Clay. go to your room.

828
00:51:27.526 --> 00:51:28.947
What?

829
00:51:28.950 --> 00:51:31.635
- How is that fair?
- Go to your goddamn room!

830
00:51:31.638 --> 00:51:32.907
Now!

831
00:51:38.329 --> 00:51:40.746
[MATT] Enough is enough. This
family will not be destroyed.

832
00:51:40.748 --> 00:51:43.999
Not for any case. not for any
other parents' kid. not by drugs.

833
00:51:44.001 --> 00:51:46.835
We will not let this
happen. I get it. you're mad.

834
00:51:46.837 --> 00:51:48.923
I'm mad at him. too. but he is a child!

835
00:51:55.429 --> 00:51:58.390
[OLIVIA] <i>How can you fix something
if you don't know what's broken?</i>

836
00:52:00.768 --> 00:52:02.061
<i>Hannah didn't tell us.</i>

837
00:52:05.856 --> 00:52:07.106
[HANNAH] Clay.

838
00:52:10.309 --> 00:52:11.487
No.

839
00:52:13.197 --> 00:52:16.406
You don't talk. You
don't get to say anything.

840
00:52:16.408 --> 00:52:20.160
This is your fucking fault.
Hannah. This mess started with you.

841
00:52:20.162 --> 00:52:23.832
I put out the tapes. and that
was stupid. but you made them.

842
00:52:24.541 --> 00:52:26.959
- You fucked up people's lives!
- I know.

843
00:52:26.961 --> 00:52:29.004
- I'm sorry.
- Are you?

844
