That doesn't do a fucking bit
of good because you are gone!

846
00:52:34.635 --> 00:52:38.428
You killed yourself and
you didn't fucking care.

847
00:52:38.430 --> 00:52:41.265
- I did!
- No. or you never would've done it.

848
00:52:41.267 --> 00:52:45.269
I was hurting. and I didn't
think about who I might hurt.

849
00:52:45.271 --> 00:52:47.564
You did an evil thing.

